"┌ Commands ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐"
"│/add-dir             Add a new working directory                                                  │"
"│/advisor             Show, set, or clear the advisor model                                        │"
"│/agents              Browse agent definitions with source + override visibility                   │"
"│/assistant          (kairos)  View assistant mode status                                          │"
"│/audit-export       (audit)  Export session as verifiable audit record (.audit.json)              │"
"│/branch             (br)  Fork the current conversation into a new branch                         │"
"│                                                                                                  │"
"│Usage: /branch [title]                                                                            │"
"│Example: /branch                                                                                  │"
"│Enter selects the command; type arguments after the inserted space.                               │"
"└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
